```modelica
partial model Root
  replaceable Real x;
end Root;

model Study
  extends Root(redeclare Real x);
  Real result;
equation
  x = time;
  result = x;
end Study;
```

What is the exact value of Study.result at t = 2 s? Return an integer or a reduced fraction.
